9ee0fe94be2e2c654571cdbd","source_row_key":null,"effective_at":null},"website":{"field":"website","status":"available","source_type":"registry_linked_company_website","source_class":"registry_linked_company_website","source_url":"https://www.equinor.com/","retrieved_at":"2026-10-08T12:45:17.020681Z","value":{"requested_url":"https://www.equinor.com/","final_url":"https://www.equinor.com/","registered_domain":"equinor.com","title":"","description":"We are an international energy company headquartered in Norway, around 25,000 employees and with offices in more than 20 countries worldwide.","main_text_excerpt":"In a world shaped by uncertainty, growing demand and the need to reduce emissions, we deliver secure and lower-emission energy.\nIn Equinor, we combine a strong oil and gas business with a growing power business, supported by trading and market expertise. This is how we will meet energy needs, strengthen energy security and create long-term value.\nWe aim to grow across oil, gas, power and trading, and to capture opportunities in a changing energy system.\nEnergy for people. Progress for society. Searching for better","social_links":[{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://facebook.com/Equinor"},{"platform":"instagram","url":"https://instagram.com/equinor"},{"platform":"linkedin","url":"https://linkedin.com/company/equinor"}],"structured_organisations":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Equinor ASA","url":"https://www.equinor.com","logo":"https://cdn.eds.equinor.com/logo/equinor-logo-horizontal.svg#red","description":"We are an international energy company headquartered in Norway, around 25,000 employees and with offices in more than 20 countries worldwide.","sameAs":["https://twitter.com/Equinor","https://facebook.com/Equinor","https://linkedin.com/company/equinor","https://www.instagram.com/equinor/","https://www.youtube.com/equinor"]}],"content_sha256":"bb057539db5cb8f01a466718c225d43a520a548ec8efc5338a34239616e57ec0","extraction_state":"static_complete","pages":[{"url":"https://www.equinor.com/","title":"","main_text_excerpt":"In a world shaped by uncertainty, growing demand and the need to reduce emissions, we deliver secure and lower-emission energy.\nIn Equinor, we combine a strong oil and gas business with a growing power business, supported by trading and market expertise. This is how we will meet energy needs, strengthen energy security and create long-term value.\nWe aim to grow across oil, gas, power and trading, and to capture opportunities in a changing energy system.\nEnergy for people. Progress for society. Searching for better","content_sha256":"bb057539db5cb8f01a466718c225d43a520a548ec8efc5338a34239616e57ec0"},{"url":"https://www.equinor.com/about-us","title":"","main_text_excerpt":"Equinor is an international energy company committed to providing reliable energy in a volatile world.\nOur purpose: Energy for people. Progress for society. Searching for better.\nWe are headquartered in Norway with around 25,000 employees and offices in more than 20 countries. A major supplier of energy to Europe, with a portfolio that encompasses oil and gas, renewables, and low-carbon solutions. Equinor is a world-leading offshore operator with a growing power business and positions in CO2 transportation and storage.\nOur deliveries of oil, gas, and wind power provide a vital contribution to Europe’s energy security.\nThe Norwegian continental shelf is the backbone of the company, while our international oil and gas portfolio is focused on a set of core positions in the US, Brazil, Angola, the UK and Canada.\nOur power business is built around onshore and offshore wind, supplemented by solar assets, in countries like Poland, the UK, Brazil and Norway.\nWe aim to provide reliable energy for a world in transition, enabling access to secure, affordable and low-emission energy for people and society. Building on a foundation of low-risk positions and 50 years of experience, we are well placed to grow our businesses and create long-term value.\nIn Equinor, we believe that collaboration across disciplines, companies, and countries holds the key to providing the reliable energy the world needs.","content_sha256":"660d25b2e968ea8a440cd92749d8a52d5c2193cc75e546e038326390d69c99fb"},{"url":"https://www.equinor.com/about-us/2026-autumn-conference","title":"","main_text_excerpt":"Autumn Conference 2026\n-\nLive stream on equinor.com","content_sha256":"0eebfc8d6771f8a941a988635afc2b8cffbe4980657318f3b993f01c9e94afaa"},{"url":"https://www.equinor.com/about-us/accessibility-statement","title":"","main_text_excerpt":"At Equinor, we aim to make our website, equinor.com, accessible to as many users as possible, and we are continuously working to improve accessibility and usability based on current standards and guidelines.\nObjectives\nOur goal is to achieve, at a minimum, Level AA compliance with the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1.\nAccessibility measures\nWe have implemented the following measures to ensure accessibility:\n- Monitoring: We use several tools to regularly monitor the website and identify necessary actions regarding accessibility.\n- Training: We have expertise in accessibility guidelines and universal design, and we stay updated on the guidelines.\n- Content: We strive to ensure that the content is written in clear language and is easy to understand.\n- Design: The website is designed to be compatible with various technological assistive devices.\nAccessibility status\nSome parts of the website are not fully accessible, including:\n- Certain PDF documents may not be fully compatible with screen readers.\n- Some videos lack captions.\n- There may be images, illustrations, and graphs without alternative text or with insufficient descriptive text.\nWe are continuously working on the accessibility of our website.","content_sha256":"74bb08e6965360a4e677e400162e232171bc859231c1b8b08e0ce175b884299e"},{"url":"https://www.equinor.com/about-us/contact-us","title":"","main_text_excerpt":"How to contact us\nFirst things first. If your enquiry is urgent or related to a safety issue, please call us immediately at the number below.\nHeadquarters: Equinor ASA\nForusbeen 50,\n4035 Stavanger,\nNorway\nSecondly, to help us help you, please send your enquiry to the right team in Equinor. You’ll find all our direct contacts below. We can only answer relevant enquiries, and we don’t respond to questions about jobs or unsolicited sales offers.","content_sha256":"e103ae57896c82554665bc48c3df0c63e8b8e9e3dcd28f87a3aad4d4597b1e81"}],"crawl_errors":[],"identity_assessment":{"status":"exact","score":0.95,"publishable":true,"legal_name_tokens":["equinor"],"matched_tokens":["equinor"],"reasons":["single distinctive legal-name token appears in homepage identity evidence with substantive content"],"method":"deterministic_name_org_evidence_v2"},"discovered_social_links":[{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://facebook.com/Equinor"},{"platform":"instagram","url":"https://instagram.com/equinor"},{"platform":"linkedin","url":"https://linkedin.com/company/equinor"}],"social_link_assessments":[{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://facebook.com/Equinor","identity_score":0.98,"publishable":true,"matched_tokens":["equinor"],"reason":"normalized legal-name sequence appears in the social handle","method":"deterministic_social_handle_identity_v1"},{"platform":"instagram","url":"https://instagram.com/equinor","identity_score":0.98,"publishable":true,"matched_tokens":["equinor"],"reason":"normalized legal-name sequence appears in the social handle","method":"deterministic_social_handle_identity_v1"},{"platform":"linkedin","url":"https://linkedin.com/company/equinor","identity_score":0.98,"publishable":true,"matched_tokens":["equinor"],"reason":"normalized legal-name sequence appears in the social handle","method":"deterministic_social_handle_identity_v1"}]},"as_of":null,"note":"Company-controlled claim layer; not an official registry fact","content_